  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed development, in the absence of an adequate site-specific Flood Risk Assessment, has failed to demonstrate how the proposal will be safe from surface water flooding on the site and will not increase the risk of flooding elsewhere. Furthermore, the proposal does not incorporate any flood-resistant or flood-resilient measures, nor does it provide level for level floodplain compensation in accordance with the drainage hierarchy set out in the London Plan. The proposal is therefore contrary to Section 14 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), to policies SI12 and SI 13 of the London Plan (2021), to policies CP21 and CP28 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), to policies DMD59, DMD60 and DMD61 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014), and the Enfield Strategic Flood Risk Assessment."
